      en: ["The Kipushi Mine was established in 1924 by Union Minière.", "The town sits directly on the international border with Zambia.", "Kipushi's Big Zinc zone is one of the world's richest zinc deposits.", "It is located only 30 kilometers southwest of Lubumbashi.", "The mine reaches depths of over 1,200 meters underground.", "Kipushi is a strategic point for mineral exports into the Southern African network."],
