      en: ["Kamituga is known as one of the most productive gold-mining regions in the Congo.", "The city is located within the Mwenga Territory of the South Kivu province.", "Industrial gold mining began here in the 1920s under the MGL company.", "The population density is unusually high for the region due to the mining boom.", "The primary link to the provincial capital Bukavu is the often impassable Route Nationale 2.", "Estimates suggest that over 200,000 people reside in the greater Kamituga area."],
