      en: ["Beni is a major center for the export of Congolese Arabica coffee.", "The city is located in close proximity to the Virunga National Park.", "Mavivi Airport serves as the primary aviation link for the city and region.", "Beni was an epicenter of the severe Ebola outbreak between 2018 and 2020.", "The city is a diocesan seat and hosts several higher education institutions.", "Route Nationale 4 connects Beni with the western city of Kisangani."],
