      en: ["Isiro was named Paulis until 1966, after the Belgian officer Albert Paulis.", "The city is a major hub for the production and trade of Robusta coffee.", "Isiro-Matari Airport provides essential air links between the province and Kinshasa.", "The town is the administrative seat of the Catholic Diocese of Isiro-Niangara.", "It was once a primary junction for the Vicicongo narrow-gauge railway system.", "Isiro is home to the University of Uele, a key institution for higher learning in the area."],
