      en: ["Buta is the seat of the Diocese of Buta, established in 1959.", "The city is situated on the Rubi River, a tributary of the Itimbiri.", "Buta served as a major junction for the Vicicongo railway system.", "The Buta Zega Airport provides air access to the remote province.", "Cotton and peanuts are the primary agricultural products of the region.", "The distance to Kisangani in the south is approximately 324 kilometers."],
