      en: ["Bikoro is situated on the eastern banks of Lake Tumba.", "Lake Tumba connects to the Congo River through the Irebu Channel.", "In 2018, Bikoro was the epicenter of a significant Ebola outbreak.", "The town is located deep within the world's second-largest rainforest.", "Lake fishing is the primary source of income for the local population.", "Bikoro was an important administrative post during the Congo Free State."],
