      en: ["Ikela endured a siege lasting over a year between 1999 and 2000.", "The town is situated on the Tshuapa River deep within the rainforest.", "Ikela Airport served as a critical strategic asset during the Congo wars.", "Ikela is part of the Tshuapa Province, which was established in 2015.", "The town is only reliably accessible by air or river transport.", "The area surrounding Ikela is known for its pristine tropical biodiversity."],
