      en: ["The first diamonds in the area were discovered in 1907.", "Tshikapa is located at the confluence of the Tshikapa and Kasaï rivers.", "The city is situated roughly 60 kilometers from the border with Angola.", "Tshikapa was designated as the provincial capital of Kasaï in 2015.", "The city's population is estimated to exceed one million people.", "It is a primary hub for both legal and artisanal diamond trading in Africa."],
