      en: ["Mweka is a station on the railway line between Ilebo and Kananga.", "A major train derailment occurred near Mweka in August 2007.", "The town was at the center of a significant Ebola outbreak in 2007.", "Mweka is situated within the cultural territory of the Kuba Kingdom.", "The town serves as a regional hub for trading cassava and maize.", "The average elevation of Mweka is approximately 600 meters above sea level."],
